sequenceDiagram
    participant Backend as Backend (Express)
    participant Adapter as CircleCompatibilityAdapter
    participant Circle as Circle Mint Sandbox
    participant Wallet as Wallet 1017459986
    participant Bank as BANK OF AMERICA

    Note over Backend,Bank: Setup Phase
    Backend->>Circle: POST /v1/businessAccount/banks/wires
    Circle-->>Backend: Wire destination created (089797c5...)
    Note over Backend: Destination linked, status: complete

    Note over Backend,Bank: Funding Phase
    Backend->>Circle: POST /v1/mocks/payments/wire
    Circle-->>Backend: Mock wire created (pending)
    Note over Circle: ~10 min sandbox settlement
    Circle->>Wallet: Balance credited ($124,855 USD)

    Note over Backend,Bank: Payout Phase
    Backend->>Adapter: createPayoutInstruction(amount=$10)
    Adapter->>Adapter: Build payload — idempotencyKey, destination, amount, source, metadata
    Adapter->>Circle: POST /v1/businessAccount/payouts
    Circle-->>Adapter: HTTP 201, payout ID, status: pending
    Adapter-->>Backend: Payout instruction created

    Note over Circle: Sandbox processing
    Circle->>Wallet: Deduct $10 from balance
    Circle->>Bank: Initiate wire transfer
    Circle-->>Bank: Wire completed (status: complete)

    Backend->>Circle: GET /v1/payouts/:id
    Circle-->>Backend: status: complete
    Backend->>Wallet: Balance: $124,845 USD

    Note over Backend,Bank: Verification
    Backend->>Circle: GET /v1/businessAccount/balances
    Circle-->>Backend: $124,845.00 USD
    Note over Backend: Payout verified
